{"id":"n15109-2-6","stage":2,"title":"얼마간 · 一段时间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15109-2-6-1","ko":"얼마간이나마 우리 하늘을 보며 누워 있자.","zh":"咱们就躺着看看天空吧，哪怕只一会儿也好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마간이나마","meaning":"一段时间，一些时间，不久，一阵子","explanation":"얼마간：一段时间，一些时间，不久，一阵子；이나마：虽不充分但仍认可：“哪怕、好歹”。","readings":[{"term":"얼마간","audio":"/audio/89c7bcace0ed86213396.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15109","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마간이나마","audio":"/audio/277dcf8f7a8420e79e87.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"하늘을","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘을","audio":"/audio/2a06f55873889f6f0e04.mp3"}},{"text":"보며","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보며","audio":"/audio/3b37eb5917af210bf39a.mp3"}},{"text":"누워","meaning":"躺","explanation":"눕다：躺；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"눕다","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62063","senseId":"1","lemma":"눕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누워","audio":"/audio/144b282ac83d37720217.mp3"}},{"text":"있자.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있자","audio":"/audio/41ccae1b5328c9f3b318.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"89c7bcace0ed8621","term":"얼마간","zh":"一段时间，一些时间，不久，一阵子","audio":"/audio/89c7bcace0ed86213396.mp3","entryId":"15109","definition":"不是特别久的时间。","pronunciation":["얼마간"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"aaed3d6f391054fe","term":"눕다","zh":"躺","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3","entryId":"62063","definition":"人或动物将背部或肋部贴附在某处而横躺下。","pronunciation":["눕ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c801ca47e672e78e00ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15109-2-6-2","ko":"그래. 와, 별 되게 많다.","zh":"好啊。哇，星星真多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"별","meaning":"星星","explanation":"별：星星","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58366","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}},{"text":"되게","meaning":"很，极了","explanation":"되게：很，极了","readings":[{"term":"되게","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14902","senseId":"1","lemma":"되게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되게","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3"}},{"text":"많다.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"星星","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"58366","definition":"夜空中闪闪发光的、除了月亮以外的天体。","pronunciation":["별ː"]},{"id":"0cf800caa3704326","term":"되게","zh":"很，极了","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3","entryId":"14902","definition":"非常，十分。","pronunciation":["되ː게","뒈ː게"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba7031915f27f8108d12.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.355,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15109","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"source